  <!--
    Document PDF/SVG/ic_fluent_document_pdf_24_regular.svg

    The PDF a document becomes: File > Export to PDF on the toolbar, and the status bar's "Open
    exported PDF". One glyph for both, deliberately — the command and the artifact it produces are
    the same subject seen a moment apart, and a reader who has learnt this icon on the status bar
    should not have to learn a second one for the command that put it there.
  -->
